        </p>

        <div class="mirror-stages">
          <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard0">
            <span class="stage-check">✓</span>
            <div class="stage-num">1</div>
            <div class="stage-name">Егор о себе</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard1">
            <span class="stage-check">✓</span>
            <div class="stage-num">2</div>
            <div class="stage-name">Ариша о себе</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stage-card" id="stageCard2">
            <span class="stage-check">✓</span>
            <div class="stage-num">3</div>
